    "title": "产品参数",
    "text": "型号与容量\n\nX200-Pro 水箱容量 4.5L，适用面积 20-40 平方米。",
    "section_path": ["产品参数", "容量"],
    "audience": "public",
    "source_url": "https://example.invalid/docs/spec"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "kb-spec#2",
    "doc_id": "kb-spec",
    "title": "产品参数",
    "text": "额定功率\n\n使用 220V/50Hz 电源，额定功率 1200W。",
    "section_path": ["产品参数", "功率"],
    "audience": "public",
    "source_url": "https://example.invalid/docs/spec"
  },
  {
